{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112060","id":2948748828,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6vwlYc","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112060","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112060.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112060.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112060","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112060/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112060/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112060/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/83fac79bf6a0b63ac6743b2229ae0537fb6561f0","number":112060,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Rework scene preview thumbnails - take 2","user":{"login":"daniel080400","id":26960237,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTYwMjM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26960237?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel080400","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Supersedes #102313 and apply related fixes: #107719 #107514 #107676\r\n\r\nAddressed issue: #107764\r\n\r\nAnd to address the performance problem mentioned at #107736, this PR adds following changes:\r\n\r\n1. Runs all thumbnail creation on a separate thread, no more progress bars\r\n2. Add an editor setting `docks/filesystem/thumbnail_file_size_threshold`. When a scene file (gltf, tscn, fbx) is queued for thumbnail creation, we first interpret the scene file with `FileAccess` directly, check for all external, internal resources it uses, and see if the accumulated size (in bytes) is larger than this threshold, if it is, we don't proceed to generate thumbnail for it, instead we give it a 2x2 dummy thumbnail.\r\n\r\n    As scene files could be large levels, and multi-threaded scene loading still isn't possible now, for creating thumbnails, we have to target files that are likely prefabs and can be loaded instantly.\r\n\r\n    * NOTE 1: I had tried counting tris and pixels for each resources, it turns out to be too slow which destroys the purpose of quick checking, and also very buggy due to `GLTFDocument` might be stateful. Estimating total file bytes seems to be the only viable option now.\r\n\r\n    * NOTE 2: Dummy thumbnail is mandatory to prevent it being queued over again, as the thumbnail generator logic will think it's aborted then proceed to retry if there's no thumbnail present.\r\n\r\n    * NOTE 3: Changing `docks/filesystem/thumbnail_file_size_threshold` won't re-queue all the files, you have to edit and re-save individually for it to update.\r\n    <img width=\"669\" height=\"140\" alt=\"thumbnail_threshold_description\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9329999f-0a0e-463f-a967-5a6c1787d482\" />\r\n\r\n    Large levels would likely be ignored by thumbnail generator with the default setting -- **64MB**:\r\n\r\n    <img width=\"1252\" height=\"157\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/156f76c3-8973-4768-b4c5-bfb2a40efc45\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n3. For stability reasons, `PackedScene::instantiate()` and `Node::queue_free()` calls are all deferred.\r\n\r\nThe main caveat of this PR is that if some scene files have ~30MB worth of bytes, it will cause frame lags, but far from rendering the editor unresponsive, suppose this price will only be paid once on a freshly opened project, this should be worth it.\r\n\r\nCode could use some clean up, testers are welcome now. I've tested with official template projects, and also a project that has numerous 50MB~100MB gltf files with 4K HDRIs, all looks good to me now.\r\n\r\n------\r\n*2025-10-27-08:30 Update*\r\n\r\nIf the code is stable and testing results are good, I plan to implement following changes by order, but no guarantees, just a list of nice-to-have if I got time.\r\n\r\n**TODO:**\r\n- [x] ~Add setting `docks/filesystem/thumbnail_max_scene_node_count`, ignore thumbnail creation if scene has too many nodes. (default 2000?)~\r\n     * ~This should account for scene files that are under file size threshold, but have a huge amount of instanced nodes sharing the same resources, which might take too much time to render in background and cause lags.~\r\n     * (2025-11-09) Edit : Discarded. Not possible to count nodes precisely without loading the files (scenes may contain gltf, fbx resources)\r\n\r\n- [x] Implement #102263 as a fallback for scene files that are too large to handle (with no options, just use fixed view)\r\n    <img width=\"507\" height=\"215\" alt=\"bring_back_save_preview_fixed\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e1fe5889-277a-487f-9d3d-52bfb9cc14a2\" />\r\n- [x] Bring back #96544 as a fallback for imported scene resources that are too large to handle","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}